 "titulo": "The last stand of the 300 ⚔️ Thermopylae Part 3 #story #shorts",
 "capa": "GO TELL THE SPARTANS",
 "descripcion": "Betrayed by a mountain path, Leonidas sends the allies home and stays with his 300, plus Thespians and Thebans, for the last stand on a small hill.\n\nWould you have stayed?\n\nFrom Herodotus, Histories, book 7 (chapters 175-228). Herodotus gives millions of Persians; modern historians estimate roughly 100,000 to 300,000.\n#thermopylae #sparta #300 #ancienthistory #shorts",
 "visual": "ilustrado",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "At dawn, the lookouts ran down the mountain *screaming*.",
   "pausa": 0.5,
   "cena": {
    "fundo": "campo_batalha-pe_torre-dourado",
    "cam": {
     "z": [
      1.75,
      1.6
     ],
     "x": 0.38,
     "y": 0.58
    },
    "fx": [
     "dourado"
    ],
    "atores": [
     {
      "id": "dienekes",
      "pose": "correr",
      "rosto": "medo",
      "v": 0.93,
      "esc": 1.15,
      "arma": false,
      "u": [
       0.3,
       0.5
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "texto": "The Persians are behind us. Ephialtes showed them the path.",
   "pausa": 0.5,
   "cena": {
    "fundo": "campo_batalha-meio-dourado",
    "cam": {
     "z": [
      1.6,
      1.45
     ],
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.58
    },
    "fx": [
     "dourado"
    ],
    "atores": [
     {
      "id": "dienekes",
      "pose": "parado",
      "rosto": "choque",
      "v": 0.93,
      "esc": 1.0,
      "arma": false,
      "u": 0.32
     },
     {
      "id": "leonidas",
      "pose": "parado",
      "rosto": "raiva",
      "v": 0.93,
      "esc": 1.0,
      "arma": false,
      "u": 0.68
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "texto": "The pass was lost. Everyone knew it.",
   "pausa": 0.5,
   "cena": {
    "fundo": "campo_batalha-vindo-tempestade",
    "cam": {
     "z": [
      1.0,
      1.08
     ],
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.45
    },
    "fx": [
     "chuva"
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "texto": "Leonidas sent most of the Greek allies home, to fight another day.",
   "pausa": 0.5,
   "cena": {
    "fundo": "campo_batalha-acostamento",
    "cam": {
     "z": [
      1.3,
      1.15
     ],
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.6
    },
    "fx": [],
    "atores": [
     {
      "id": "leonidas",
      "pose": "apontar",
      "rosto": "triste",
      "v": 0.93,
      "esc": 1.0,
      "arma": false,
      "u": 0.5
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "texto": "Three hundred Spartans stayed. And seven hundred men from Thespiae refused to leave.",
   "pausa": 0.5,
   "cena": {
    "fundo": "campo_batalha-meio",
    "cam": {
     "z": [
      1.0,
      1.12
     ],
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.55
    },
    "fx": [],
    "atores": [
     {
      "id": "leonidas",
      "pose": "lutar",
      "rosto": "raiva",
      "v": 0.93,
      "esc": 1.0,
      "arma": "lanca",
      "u": 0.32
     },
     {
      "id": "dienekes",
      "pose": "lutar",
      "rosto": "raiva",
      "v": 0.93,
      "esc": 1.0,
      "arma": "escudo",
      "u": 0.68
     }
    ],
    "cartao": {
     "tipo": "fato",
     "titulo": "Who stayed to fight",
     "valor": "1,000",
     "sub": "300 Spartans and 700 Thespians",
     "t0": 0.4
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "texto": "Stay, because what they did with their last morning still has no equal.",
   "pausa": 0.5,
   "cena": {
    "fundo": "esparta_cidade-praca-tempestade",
    "cam": {
     "z": [
      1.08,
      1.0
     ],
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.45
    },
    "fx": [
     "chuva"
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "texto": "They didn't wait behind the wall anymore. They *charged*.",
   "pausa": 0.5,
   "cena": {
    "fundo": "campo_batalha-indo-tempestade",
    "cam": {
     "z": [
      1.15,
      1.3
     ],
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.6
    },
    "fx": [
     "chuva"
    ],
    "atores": [
     {
      "id": "leonidas",
      "pose": "correr",
      "rosto": "raiva",
      "v": 0.93,
      "esc": 1.0,
      "arma": "lanca",
      "u": 0.32
     },
     {
      "id": "dienekes",
      "pose": "correr",
      "rosto": "raiva",
      "v": 0.93,
      "esc": 1.0,
      "arma": "escudo",
      "u": 0.68
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "texto": "Out into the open, straight into the Persian army.",
   "pausa": 0.5,
   "cena": {
    "fundo": "campo_batalha-vindo-tempestade",
    "cam": {
     "z": [
      1.32,
      1.2
     ],
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.66
    },
    "fx": [
     "chuva"
    ],
    "atores": [
     {
      "id": "leonidas",
      "pose": "golpe",
      "rosto": "raiva",
      "v": 0.93,
      "esc": 1.0,
      "arma": "lanca",
      "u": 0.5
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "texto": "Their spears broke. They fought on with swords.",
   "pausa": 0.5,
   "cena": {
    "fundo": "campo_batalha-meio-tempestade",
    "cam": {
     "z": [
      1.45,
      1.6
     ],
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.58
    },
    "fx": [
     "chuva"
    ],
    "atores": [
     {
      "id": "dienekes",
      "pose": "golpe",
      "rosto": "raiva",
      "v": 0.93,
      "esc": 1.0,
      "arma": "espada",
      "u": 0.5
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "texto": "Leonidas fell. The Spartans fought four times to recover his body, and won it back.",
   "pausa": 0.5,
   "cena": {
    "fundo": "campo_batalha-curva-tempestade",
    "cam": {
     "z": [
      1.32,
      1.2
     ],
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.66
    },
    "fx": [
     "chuva"
    ],
    "atores": [
     {
      "id": "leonidas",
      "pose": "cair",
      "rosto": "triste",
      "v": 0.93,
      "esc": 1.0,
      "arma": false,
      "u": 0.5
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "texto": "Then they pulled back to a small hill, back to back.",
   "pausa": 0.5,
   "cena": {
    "fundo": "campo_batalha-pe_torre-tempestade",
    "cam": {
     "z": [
      1.15,
      1.3
     ],
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.6
    },
    "fx": [
     "chuva"
    ],
    "atores": [
     {
      "id": "dienekes",
      "pose": "lutar",
      "rosto": "raiva",
      "v": 0.93,
      "esc": 1.0,
      "arma": "escudo",
      "u": 0.5
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "texto": "Herodotus says they fought with swords, then hands, then *teeth*.",
   "pausa": 0.5,
   "cena": {
    "fundo": "campo_batalha-pe_torre-tempestade",
    "cam": {
     "z": [
      1.6,
      1.45
     ],
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.58
    },
    "fx": [
     "chuva"
    ],
    "atores": [
     {
      "id": "dienekes",
      "pose": "golpe",
      "rosto": "raiva",
      "v": 0.93,
      "esc": 1.0,
      "arma": false,
      "u": 0.5
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "texto": "Until arrows covered the hill, and the last one fell.",
   "pausa": 0.5,
   "cena": {
    "fundo": "campo_batalha-pe_torre-dourado",
    "cam": {
     "z": [
      1.0,
      1.08
     ],
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.45
    },
    "fx": [],
    "atores": [
     {
      "id": "dienekes",
      "pose": "cair",
      "rosto": "triste",
      "v": 0.93,
      "esc": 1.0,
      "arma": false,
      "u": 0.5
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "texto": "Xerxes won the pass. But Greece had time to prepare.",
   "pausa": 0.5,
   "cena": {
    "fundo": "campo_batalha-vindo-dourado",
    "cam": {
     "z": [
      1.3,
      1.15
     ],
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.6
    },
    "fx": [],
    "atores": [
     {
      "id": "xerxes",
      "pose": "triunfo",
      "rosto": "sorriso",
      "v": 0.93,
      "esc": 1.0,
      "arma": false,
      "u": 0.5
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "texto": "That same year, the Persian fleet was crushed at Salamis.",
   "pausa": 0.5,
   "cena": {
    "fundo": "mar_jangada-mar-tempestade",
    "cam": {
     "z": [
      1.0,
      1.08
     ],
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.45
    },
    "fx": [
     "chuva"
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "texto": "Later, the poet Simonides wrote a line for their stone.",
   "pausa": 0.5,
   "cena": {
    "fundo": "esparta_cidade-templo-dourado",
    "cam": {
     "z": [
      1.3,
      1.15
     ],
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.6
    },
    "fx": [
     "dourado"
    ],
    "cartao": {
     "tipo": "nome",
     "titulo": "Simonides",
     "sub": "Greek poet",
     "t0": 0.4
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "texto": "Go tell the Spartans, stranger passing by, that here, obedient to their laws, we lie.",
   "pausa": 0.8,
   "cena": {
    "fundo": "campo_batalha-meio-dourado",
    "cam": {
     "z": [
      1.0,
      1.12
     ],
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.55
    },
    "fx": [
     "dourado"
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "texto": "All because you woke up as one of three hundred.",
   "pausa": 0.3,
   "cena": {
    "fundo": "campo_batalha-vindo-tempestade",
    "cam": {
     "z": [
      1.08,
      1.0
     ],
